This is an unofficial client for Paseo (https://paseo.sh). It is not affiliated
with or endorsed by the Paseo project.

The protocol notes in docs/protocol/ and docs/ui/ were written by reading the
source code of Paseo (https://github.com/getpaseo/paseo),
Copyright (c) 2025-present Mohamed Boudra, licensed under the Apache License 2.0.
No Paseo source code is included in this repository.

The app icon is derived from the Paseo logo
(packages/website/public/logo.svg in the Paseo repository).

Third-party components:
- SwiftTerm (https://github.com/migueldeicaza/SwiftTerm), MIT License
- Mermaid (https://github.com/mermaid-js/mermaid), MIT License, loaded at
  runtime from jsDelivr to render diagrams
